From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Local Build <local@openwrt>
Date: Fri, 6 Mar 2026 09:21:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mips: ralink: mt7621: enable cpufreq prerequisites

MT7621 cpufreq depends on the generic MIPS cpufreq menu being visible:

  if CPU_SUPPORTS_CPUFREQ && MIPS_EXTERNAL_TIMER
    source "drivers/cpufreq/Kconfig"
  endif

For SOC_MT7621 these prerequisite symbols are not selected by default,
so CONFIG_CPU_FREQ/CONFIG_MT7621_CPUFREQ from target config fragments
are dropped as unknown and no cpufreq sysfs policy appears at runtime.

Select the two prerequisite symbols for SOC_MT7621 to make cpufreq
available for the MT7621 cpufreq driver.

Signed-off-by: Local Build <local@openwrt>
---
 arch/mips/ralink/Kconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/mips/ralink/Kconfig
+++ b/arch/mips/ralink/Kconfig
@@ -49,6 +49,8 @@ choice
 		select MIPS_GIC
 		select CLKSRC_MIPS_GIC
 		select HAVE_PCI
+		select CPU_SUPPORTS_CPUFREQ
+		select MIPS_EXTERNAL_TIMER
 		select PCI_DRIVERS_GENERIC
 		select SOC_BUS
 		select PINCTRL
